.SH NAME
wildtype_means \- Get the currently effective wildtype (baseline) expression vector of the model.
.SH SYNOPSIS
\fIwildtype_means(\fBmodel\fR as <generic> ElasticNet);\fR
.SH DESCRIPTION
.PP
Get the currently effective wildtype (baseline) expression vector of the model.
.PP
.SH OPTIONS
.PP
\fBmodel\fB \fR\- the perturbation engine that is created via \fBelastic_model\fR. 
.PP
.SH VALUE
.PP
a numeric vector, one value per gene, in the same order as \fBgene_names\fR.
 Before \fBset_baseline\fR is called this is the sample mean of the training matrix.
.PP
